This project provided hands-on experience with:

- ROS 2 software architecture
- Navigation2 (Nav2)
- Gazebo simulation
- TurtleBot3 integration
- Robot localization
- Costmap tuning
- TF debugging
- Autonomous navigation
- Path planning
